@host = http://localhost:5223
@correlationId = dev-{{$guid}}

### Root → 302 redirect to /health/live
GET {{host}}/

### Health: liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Health: readiness (需要 MSSQL，無 DB 會 503)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Ping
GET {{host}}/api/common/ping
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Ping: echo (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/common/ping/echo
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "message": "hello from .http"
}

### Ping: echo — validation fail (空 message)
POST {{host}}/api/common/ping/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

### Ping: fail — 故意觸發 500（測錯誤 log + ProblemDetails）
GET {{host}}/api/common/ping/fail
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Test: throw (Dev only)
GET {{host}}/api/test/throw

### Test: echo GET (Dev only)
GET {{host}}/api/test/echo

### Test: echo POST (Dev only)
POST {{host}}/api/test/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anything": "goes"
}

### Test: auth whoami (Dev only)
GET {{host}}/api/test/auth/whoami

### Test: auth admin (Dev only)
GET {{host}}/api/test/auth/admin

### OpenAPI spec (Dev only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
